# Every image under a QA run, wherever it sits. A device screenshot carries
# the machine's name and its LAN/tailnet address in plain text, and this
# repository is public — the directory rules above only caught the files that
# happened to be filed tidily.
QA/runs/**/*.png
QA/runs/**/*.jpg
QA/runs/**/*.jpeg
QA/runs/**/*.mp4
